			"notes": "### showtime! i hope i don't update this again in the next 5 days\n\n* Fixed coral fans not being included in #familiar_things\n* Fixed an issue that allowed use of flint and steel etc. on the summoning table when it was busy\n* Fixed ???\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/afamiliarquiet/familiar-magic/compare/v1.1.3...v1.1.4\n\n\n..oh, and a secret bonus. the +foxful versions have no UUID check on the fox transformation, so feel free to play around with the odd trinket and yip about it.\nrclick on another player to turn them into a fox, or sneak+rclick on any entity to turn yourself into a fox."
